<title>USA: Electrochemical plants restart operations.</title>
<headline>Electrochemical plants restart operations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrochemical Industries Ltd said Monday its plants returned to full operation after Carmel Olefins Ltd renewed its supply of ethylene to the company.</p>
<p>Electrochemical Industries, which produces PVC, was one of the companies affected by the shutdown of Carmel, which is Israel's only producer of ethylene.</p>
<p>Electrochemical Industries was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
</text>
